# P6-M027 — docker build context hygiene for the gateway image.
#
# The gateway Dockerfile copies the rust/ workspace; the build must NOT
# ship the host target/ tree (GBs, host-specific artifacts) — cargo
# rebuilds inside the image. rust-toolchain.toml MUST come through (the
# workspace pins 1.98.1 and Cargo manifests reference tests/ paths that
# must exist for manifest parsing).
rust/target
